@startuml
title Activity Diagram: UC-04 Manage Stocks

|Staff/Admin|
start
:Select "Manage Stocks" from the Admin Panel Dashboard\n(or respond to stock/sync alert);

|System|
:Retrieve and display current stock levels,\nlow-stock alerts, and item logs;

if (Trigger source?) then (Manual Staff Management)
  |Staff/Admin|
  :Review stock levels, input new stock shipments,\nadjust quantities, or update low-stock thresholds;
  :Save stock updates;

  |System|
  :Validate inputs (check for valid non-negative quantities)[cite: 1];

  if (Inputs valid and non-negative?) then (Yes)
    :Record updated stock quantities in database,\nrefresh view, and display confirmation message[cite: 1];
  else (No)
    :Highlight invalid/negative field,\ndisplay error message, and prevent saving[cite: 1];
    
    |Staff/Admin|
    :Correct input and resubmit[cite: 1];
  endif

else (Automated Order / Sync Event)
  |System|
  :Process automated stock check, deduction,\nrestoration, or third-party sync event[cite: 1];

  if (Event type?) then (Order Placement / Confirmation)
    if (Sufficient stock available?) then (Yes)
      :Automatically deduct reserved quantities\nfrom stocks[cite: 1];
      :Flag items or trigger low-stock notifications\nif quantities drop below thresholds[cite: 1];
    else (No - Insufficient Stock)
      :Flag order item and notify customer\nwith substitute or cancellation options[cite: 1];
    endif
  else if (Order Cancellation)
    :Automatically release reserved stock\nback into inventory[cite: 1];
  else (Third-Party Sync Failure)
    :Log error and alert Staff/Admin\nto manually reconcile stock count[cite: 1];
    
    |Staff/Admin|
    :Review alert and manually reconcile stock count[cite: 1];
  endif
endif

|System|
stop
@enduml
